  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Other\n\n- *(deps)* bump unicode-width from 0.2.2 to 0.2.3 ([#753](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/753))\n- *(deps)* bump aws-sdk-mwaa from 1.126.0 to 1.127.0 ([#752](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/752))\n\n## Install flowrs-tui 0.16.3\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install jvanbuel/flowrs/flowrs\n```\n\n## Download flowrs-tui 0.16.3\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.3/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
